@startuml SequenceDiagram_TicketPurchase

actor Passenger
actor Employee
participant System
participant Ticket
participant FlightSchedule
participant TicketSale

Passenger -> Employee: Solicita compra de tiquete
Employee -> System: Busca programaciones disponibles
System -> Employee: Retorna lista de vuelos
Employee -> System: Registra datos del pasajero
System -> Ticket: Crea boleto y asocia a pasajero y vuelo
System -> TicketSale: Registra venta de tiquete
Employee -> Passenger: Entrega tiquete

@enduml
